Panel: five delegates, disjoint by perspective — writing sub-agents, all five dispatched in a single message so the panelists run concurrently. No question precedes it: fanning out is the chair's call and it does not ask (§6.1). Only a host that offers no dispatch, or one that refuses the call, takes the `quick` path — the meta-review then says `mode: quick`, which is the honest name for a panel that was never independent, and the digest names the fan-out that did not fire. Each brief contains
